A||||4||Jay||Monday Night show and shine (Toronto)||||1||
Z||000000||Jay||05-18-2001||05:51 PM||||This holiday Monday starting at around 4:30 the Thornhill Cruisers have invited the GTA Fiero club to attend their annual charity show and shine.  Located on the corner of John and Bayview in Thronhill (Bayview between Finch and Steeles).  Entry is free if you bring a can of food.  You don't have to be in the club or own a Fiero.  Most cars are 50's and 60's but Fieros are  the exception.  Hope to see some new faces!!  <P><P>------------------<BR>Jay<BR>1986 Northstar GT<BR>www.members.home.net/jaygrande||||reg||1
Z||000001||PBJ||05-18-2001||09:36 PM||||"Fieros are the exception"  Is that the normal for cruise nights all over?  I thought your car had to be 20 years + but I have never gone driving a fiero before.<BR>What have people found as a reaction to showing up in a fiero for show purposes. ||||reg||1
Z||000002||Jay||05-18-2001||11:22 PM||||We are the "exception" at the Thornhill Cruisers only.  Because some of our members have classic cars and belong to the Thornhill Cruisers, they have invited us to attend.  We have done so for the last three years and we have been well recieved.  We all park together and get alot of looks.  Looking forward to about 20 Fieros.<BR>At our own GTA club show we have about 100 Fieros show up and invite a few of the cruisers.  We can't invite more classics because of limited space.  After all, the club show is for Fieros.  We'd rather have Fieros at the Fiero show than anything else.<BR><P>------------------<BR>Jay<BR>1986 Northstar GT<BR>www.members.home.net/jaygrande||||reg||1
Z||000003||PBJ||05-19-2001||08:14 PM||||Do you have more direct directions or a map?<BR>Not sure if we'll go but we would like more<BR>info. . .||||reg||1
Z||000004||Jay||05-20-2001||10:10 AM||||It's very easy.  Take the 401 to Bayview (just east of Yonge Street).  Go North passed Finch Ave.  The mall and parking lot is on the east side a good ways aftr Finch.  If you pass Steeles Ave, you've gone to far!  The show is in the parking lot.  There is a Winners in the mall.  Officially, it starts at 6:00 but people will start parking cars there at about 4:30-5:00 to get a good spot.  All the Fieros will be parked together.<P>------------------<BR>Jay<BR>1986 Northstar GT<BR>www.members.home.net/jaygrande||||reg||1
